<item><title>Guinea’s bauxite company seeks samplers for Kamsar site</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/gn/guinea-s-bauxite-company-seeks-samplers-for-kamsar-site-bd1cf3/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/gn/guinea-s-bauxite-company-seeks-samplers-for-kamsar-site-bd1cf3/</guid><category>Guinea</category><description>The hires would collect and prepare bauxite samples, measure moisture and grain size, and send results to engineers and operators.</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 11:00:12 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/gn.jpg" length="31286" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/gn.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Doumbouya appoints 38 senior officials to Guinea’s health ministry</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/gn/doumbouya-appoints-38-senior-officials-to-guinea-s-health-9797aa/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/gn/doumbouya-appoints-38-senior-officials-to-guinea-s-health-9797aa/</guid><category>Guinea</category><description>The appointments cover public health oversight, hospitals, nutrition, laboratories and the fight against disease.</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 09:10:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/gn.jpg" length="31286" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/gn.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Guinea prosecutors seek 10 years for two police officers in theft case</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/gn/guinea-prosecutors-seek-10-years-for-two-police-officers-in-be007e/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/gn/guinea-prosecutors-seek-10-years-for-two-police-officers-in-be007e/</guid><category>Guinea</category><description>The prosecution also wants each of the two officers to pay a 5 million Guinean franc fine, with a ruling due on 30 November.</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 07:43:16 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/gn.jpg" length="31286" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/gn.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
